{
  "id": "PSA.50",
  "number": "50",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 50",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "50",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 50"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "50",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm of Asaph.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The mighty God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", hath spoken, and called the earth from the rising of the sun unto the going down thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Out of Zion, the perfection of beauty, God hath shined.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our God shall come, and shall not keep silence: a fire shall devour before him, and it shall be very tempestuous round about him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall call to the heavens from above, and to the earth, that he may judge his people.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gather my saints together unto me; those that have made a covenant with me by sacrifice.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the heavens shall declare his righteousness: for God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "judge himself. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear, O my people, and I will speak; O Israel, and I will testify against thee: I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will not reprove thee for thy sacrifices or thy burnt offerings,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to have been",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "continually before me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will take no bullock out of thy house,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "nor",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he goats out of thy folds.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For every beast of the forest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the cattle upon a thousand hills.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I know all the fowls of the mountains: and the wild beasts of the field",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If I were hungry, I would not tell thee: for the world",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mine, and the fulness thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Will I eat the flesh of bulls, or drink the blood of goats?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Offer unto God thanksgiving; and pay thy vows unto the most High:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And call upon me in the day of trouble: I will deliver thee, and thou shalt glorify me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But unto the wicked God saith, What hast thou to do to declare my statutes, or",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou shouldest take my covenant in thy mouth?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seeing thou hatest instruction, and castest my words behind thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When thou sawest a thief, then thou consentedst with him, and hast been partaker with adulterers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou givest thy mouth to evil, and thy tongue frameth deceit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 50:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou sittest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.50.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.50.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.50.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.50.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
